## Closure: br-lamf (PeachAnchor, 2026-10-04)

**Work:** 8d13a4d, tree 15913c94, on parent e6361cd (W16.2).
- The private gate passed on db73ea46, the same 3 paths on 18953f4: 80/80, DIFFERENTIAL 16.
